      "notes": "對應「學生自我評估表」：我能準確地辨認四分音符、二分音符。三格是要加油、做到了、做得很好。請學生在自己的工作紙用顏色塗臉，不要交姓名到這頁。若用 iPad 按鈕，只顯示全班舉手後較多的那個表情，作為收結，不代表個別學生。",
      "html": "<section class=\"nv-slide nv-sun\" id=\"nv-self\" aria-label=\"自我評估\"><p class=\"nv-kicker\">學生自我評估</p><h2>我能準確地辨認這兩個音符</h2><div class=\"nv-pair\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><article class=\"nv-card\"><span class=\"nv-sym nv-q\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四分音符，一拍\">&#xE1D5;</span><strong>四分音符</strong><small>一拍</small></article><article class=\"nv-card\"><span class=\"nv-sym nv-h\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"二分音符，兩拍\">&#xE1D3;</span><strong>二分音符</strong><small>兩拍</small></article></div><div class=\"nv-faces\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"nv-face nv-try\" data-face=\"self-try\" data-action=\"self-try\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">😟</span><small>要加油</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"nv-face nv-ok\" data-face=\"self-ok\" data-action=\"self-ok\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">😐</span><small>做到了</small></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"nv-face nv-good\" data-face=\"self-good\" data-action=\"self-good\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">😊</span><small>做得很好</small></button></div></section>",
